  (text "Burst-detector HAT v0 (lap counter): loop -> splitter -> SDR + 3-8 MHz band-pass -> AD8307 RSSI -> LM393 -> GPIO17" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e62eb0b9-488c-570a-aad5-065d2855b7c0"))
  (text "J1 takes the loop's 1:9 balun coax. Resistive splitter (3x 16.5R) sends -6 dB to J2 (RTL-SDR) and -6 dB to the detector." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 25.40 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "81dd3393-22a8-5f89-85a2-cd9ba390a3cd"))
  (text "Filter: 3 MHz T high-pass (1n/1.5u/1n) + 8 MHz pi low-pass (390p/2.2u/390p), 50 ohm; 52.3R terminates into the AD8307." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "d5c292fc-e366-5b76-88ef-35f038c69ac8"))
  (text "RSSI = AD8307 OUT (25 mV/dB). RV1 sets THRESH (0-3.3 V). BURST is open-collector, pulled to 3.3 V: safe for Pi GPIO." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "b2e4dfa9-5656-5f6e-b663-d42ce0faafd3"))
  (text "ADS1115 at I2C 0x48 (ADDR=GND): AIN0 = RSSI, AIN1 = THRESH, ALERT/RDY -> GPIO27. J4 = PoE pins, pass-through only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "3dd5831d-b934-5254-b5e3-0f933ecb098c"))
